flowchart LR
  subgraph R[Root ownership]
    Req[Immutable request and separate release/native/checkpoint/resource trust]
    Reader[Later independent reader and root performance admission]
  end
  subgraph A[Isolated ABC coordinator package]
    Runner[python -m abc_bench.runner\nnew visual-method-evaluation route]
    Dispatch[Stdlib request and receipt validator]
    Boot[Stdlib pinned bootstrap\nverify inherited lock and direct parent]
    Guard[Bounded inherited-lock guardian\nowned lifetime checks only]
  end
  subgraph C[Original public ABC campaign]
    Lock[One original GPU0 flock and ledger\nfull reservation before dispatch]
    Evidence[Producer receipt and unresolved tombstone\nno automatic performance credit]
  end
  subgraph S[Separate isolated NRH worker]
    Eval[Unchanged revision-2 public CLI\nsix matched evaluation protocols]
    Native[Actual native/model execution\nnot launched or admitted by these CPU tests]
  end
  Req -->|Pinned data| Dispatch
  Dispatch -->|Validated request| Runner
  Runner -->|Control: reserve and retain| Lock
  Runner -->|Control: exactly one Popen| Boot
  Boot -->|Control: fork outside worker group| Guard
  Guard -->|Control: inherited same lock| Lock
  Runner -->|Control: exact lifetime acknowledgment| Boot
  Boot -->|Control: direct exec, same runner parent| Eval
  Eval -.->|Later separate native gates| Native
  Eval -->|Pinned raw receipt| Dispatch
  Dispatch -->|Current invocation physical counts| Evidence
  Guard -->|Death/watchdog: kill verified owned group, retain reservation| Evidence
  Evidence -->|Later review data| Reader
